  "changelog": "GraphQL language server package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nRequires an existing Node.js >= 22.19.0. Qualification used Node.js 22.19.0; upstream supported-major restrictions still apply. Cadencr does not install Node.js or resolve project dependencies. Requires a project schema and GraphQL configuration; remote schema fetching is outside offline qualification.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:4a6fab1bc7347a5fd49078f0928c1cb294a122fbef88ce283cb19855fccc51b9 -->"
